{"id":"673383a3-47e7-4127-b95c-1cc60a180539","expr":"result == null || result.equals(cls.getProtectionDomain().getCodeSource().getLocation().getFile())","rationale":"If result is not null, it must correspond to the file path of the class's code source location, as established by the method's return logic.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getCodeBase(Class<?>):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.169040233Z"}
