{"id":"ae462b98-e730-42fb-afe5-c1accba01c3b","expr":"(cls.getProtectionDomain().getCodeSource() == null) == (result == null)","rationale":"If the code source of the class's protection domain is null, the result must be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getCodeBase(Class<?>):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.169040233Z"}
{"id":"be783cae-7375-457d-9d0f-23e45e3947c1","expr":"(cls.getProtectionDomain().getCodeSource().getLocation() == null) == (result == null)","rationale":"If the location of the code source is null, the result must be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getCodeBase(Class<?>):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.169040233Z"}
{"id":"5b896b02-1ed7-449d-ae7f-6463e57a15f1","expr":"i >= 0","rationale":"i must be a valid index into the actualTypeArguments array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getGenericClass(Class<?>,int):Class<?>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.174261273Z"}
{"id":"614d6a05-99ec-4fc4-8fe3-1f90c39abc99","expr":"cls != null && result != null && cls.isAssignableFrom(result)","rationale":"If cls is not null, the result is not null and is a subclass or the same class as cls.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getGenericClass(Class<?>):Class<?>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.174512828Z"}
{"id":"8d82a383-4841-414a-9933-24b0a590d597","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a Class object representing the generic class, which should never be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getGenericClass(Class<?>):Class<?>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.174512828Z"}
{"id":"1bed3746-8fdf-4928-ae67-c42cdc2b8ebf","expr":"result.isAssignableFrom(result)","rationale":"The returned Class object is assignable from itself.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getGenericClass(Class<?>):Class<?>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.174512828Z"}
{"id":"04ff79f9-8c56-482d-bae4-486a53d4da6b","expr":"!cls.isPrimitive() || !result.isPrimitive()","rationale":"Either cls or the result is not primitive, reflecting generic type relations.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getGenericClass(Class<?>):Class<?>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.174512828Z"}
{"id":"3a1d8385-b095-4c6d-a01e-fa79e3300f59","expr":"cls != null && cls.isAssignableFrom(cls)","rationale":"Demonstrates a fundamental property of Class objects, ensuring cls is non-null and reflexive with isAssignableFrom method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getGenericClass(Class<?>):Class<?>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.174327257Z"}
{"id":"2569c486-b3c1-444f-8f9e-3f204e0290e7","expr":"cls.getName() != null","rationale":"The class name should always be non-null for any Class object.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getGenericClass(Class<?>):Class<?>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.174327257Z"}
{"id":"45eb561e-dd75-46dd-b4f6-5b1dfd8c2810","expr":"cls.isInterface() == false || cls.isAnnotation()","rationale":"Indicates that if cls is an interface it might also be an annotation, capturing relationships of class modifiers.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getGenericClass(Class<?>):Class<?>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.174327257Z"}
{"id":"d8fa0f84-fd5e-4368-92bb-c07fb25f48f4","expr":"cls.getTypeParameters() != null","rationale":"Class.getTypeParameters never returns null; it returns empty array if no parameters exist.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getGenericClass(Class<?>):Class<?>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.174327257Z"}
{"id":"f36ba9ad-2b89-41cf-9507-409f984352fc","expr":"m != null","rationale":"The method parameter m must be non-null for the method to execute correctly.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getName(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.174713356Z"}
{"id":"b6480a6a-9c9e-49c8-ac99-95ce4552dc27","expr":"m.getName() != null","rationale":"A Method's getName() should return a non-null string representing the method's name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getName(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.174713356Z"}
{"id":"48504ba6-f042-4b79-aa80-b1d462bed2a9","expr":"m.getReturnType() != null","rationale":"Every Method object should have a non-null return type Class object.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getName(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.174713356Z"}
{"id":"7d9cf8ba-de3b-4b43-ad71-7c8ecd019302","expr":"m.getParameterTypes() != null","rationale":"The parameter types array of a Method is always non-null (empty if no parameters).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getName(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.174713356Z"}
{"id":"b6bc9281-19c0-4ebc-a20f-a538c3e1f3c9","expr":"m.getParameterTypes().length >= 0","rationale":"Array length is always zero or positive, reflecting the number of method parameters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getName(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.174713356Z"}
{"id":"bfeb56cb-739e-4bd5-8e1e-3d8ca59ae32e","expr":"result.equals(c.getName()) || result.startsWith(c.getComponentType().getName())","rationale":"At method exit, result corresponds to c.getName() if not array, or component type's name plus appended brackets.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.184083240Z"}
{"id":"b54235d3-a7ed-4459-83d7-ff79ce7f3a0b","expr":"result.endsWith(\"][]\") || result.equals(c.getName())","rationale":"The method appends '[]' brackets for array types, so result must either equal c.getName() or end with brackets.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.184083240Z"}
{"id":"5f1137b2-4026-4b05-bde9-c064dce1323e","expr":"c.isArray() == result.contains(\"[]\")","rationale":"Array types produce names with '[]'; non-arrays do not.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.184083240Z"}
{"id":"737cb7e3-877a-4997-87cf-6eecb41b51be","expr":"result.startsWith(c.getName().replace(\"[]\", \"\"))","rationale":"The base name starts with the base component type name of the class.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.184083240Z"}
{"id":"9925b154-033f-49de-bae4-1186de102306","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a valid string representing a non-null class name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.184083240Z"}
{"id":"629270c2-aeff-4ae7-b946-a2fee2bff377","expr":"result.contains(m.getName())","rationale":"The result string always contains the method's name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getName(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.202827748Z"}
{"id":"ff2dc9a4-26b0-4505-be4f-72030e559fe5","expr":"result.endsWith(\")\")","rationale":"The result string ends with a closing parenthesis enclosing the parameter list.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getName(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.202827748Z"}
{"id":"5375fbb5-a869-4904-92a9-2e064869debd","expr":"!result.contains(\"(\") || result.indexOf('(') > result.indexOf(m.getName())","rationale":"If the result string contains '(', it appears after the method name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getName(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.202827748Z"}
{"id":"fbecfe0b-c6eb-43f5-9978-b335f2d985c9","expr":"result.length() >= m.getName().length()","rationale":"The length of result is at least as long as the method name's length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getName(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.202827748Z"}
{"id":"b3e33659-82a3-4d6e-ba29-cb2cec0aaa32","expr":"methodName != null && !methodName.isEmpty()","rationale":"Signature generation requires a non-null, non-empty methodName.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getSignature(String,Class<?>[]):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.208705929Z"}
{"id":"07103d6e-3314-404c-acdc-4cd5d2695320","expr":"parameterTypes == null || parameterTypes.length >= 0","rationale":"Parameter types can be null or empty, no negative sizes.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getSignature(String,Class<?>[]):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.208705929Z"}
{"id":"bbee278c-1e9c-45ef-9869-c2bb617704d4","expr":"methodName.indexOf('(') == -1 && methodName.indexOf(')') == -1","rationale":"Method name strings are not expected to contain parentheses as the signature format adds them.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getSignature(String,Class<?>[]):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.208705929Z"}
{"id":"6a2efe27-f591-461d-9777-2057616952c4","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns a String description representing the class type descriptor, which is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(Class<?>):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.220953437Z"}
{"id":"79f7482f-8ed4-41ab-ae95-afb9b2c2532d","expr":"result.startsWith(\"[\") == c.isArray() || !c.isArray()","rationale":"If the original class c was an array, the result string starts with '[' (one or more).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(Class<?>):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.220953437Z"}
{"id":"358671e1-f814-4906-819a-146896f4d183","expr":"!c.isPrimitive() || (result.length() == 1)","rationale":"If c is primitive, the descriptor is a single character; else descriptor is longer.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(Class<?>):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.220953437Z"}
{"id":"97f8aa64-2384-4f22-83d8-a5e7863b0e60","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method builds and returns a String based on constructor parameter types, so result is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getName(Constructor<?>):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.222593073Z"}
{"id":"35fc8da8-524b-4b34-8860-e87cd6d3cff9","expr":"result.startsWith(\"(\")","rationale":"The returned string starts with '(' according to method implementation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getName(Constructor<?>):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.222593073Z"}
{"id":"4feb9744-15a4-4e30-9804-f42750c2c527","expr":"result.endsWith(\")\")","rationale":"The returned string ends with ')' according to method implementation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getName(Constructor<?>):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.222593073Z"}
{"id":"7c75aa06-fc71-4f8c-8a4d-b43ea4cdda0b","expr":"result.contains(\"(\")","rationale":"By construction, the result string always contains '('.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getName(Constructor<?>):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.222593073Z"}
{"id":"cd356009-a4cb-47d2-ae95-64b86e875984","expr":"!result.contains(\"[\")","rationale":"The returned string does not contain '[' character as per method logic.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getName(Constructor<?>):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.222593073Z"}
{"id":"f1503703-ab73-4a61-b79d-3869438d86ef","expr":"result.startsWith(methodName + '(')","rationale":"The method appends the methodName and then '(' at the start of result.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getSignature(String,Class<?>[]):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.226344317Z"}
{"id":"752fc6da-6720-42c5-a84b-d4bf19e2a5f6","expr":"result.endsWith(\")\")","rationale":"The returned signature ends with a closing parenthesis as per method implementation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getSignature(String,Class<?>[]):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.226344317Z"}
{"id":"eca0b72c-d9ed-40d3-9dae-90d038d857b8","expr":"(parameterTypes == null || parameterTypes.length == 0) == result.equals(methodName + \"()\")","rationale":"If no parameter types are given, the signature is methodName plus '()'.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getSignature(String,Class<?>[]):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.226344317Z"}
{"id":"7c7cd475-81e7-416d-b15b-7ded24b1c68d","expr":"parameterTypes != null && parameterTypes.length > 0 == result.contains(\",\")","rationale":"If parameterTypes has length > 0, the result contains commas separating parameters (except if there's one parameter, no comma). This invariant approximates presence of parameters and commas.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getSignature(String,Class<?>[]):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.226344317Z"}
{"id":"adf2d2fc-bfd1-4f7e-8ba7-b1350fc3f495","expr":"cs != null && cs.length >= 0","rationale":"cs is an array and cannot have negative length; the method expects cs not to be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(Class<?>[]):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.245713134Z"}
{"id":"bd0346e7-b2e6-4582-ac58-e510b515d4a3","expr":"cs.length == 0 || cs.length > 0","rationale":"cs length is zero or positive, covering all possible array lengths.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(Class<?>[]):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.245713134Z"}
{"id":"4b4e31a4-72eb-4084-bac5-8c7078033e70","expr":"m.getName() != null","rationale":"The method name is always non-null as per Java Method contract.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.246515750Z"}
{"id":"1067c420-7b63-4647-a340-3f52dae8f120","expr":"m.getParameterTypes() != null","rationale":"The parameter types array is always non-null by the Method API.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.246515750Z"}
{"id":"397c5339-f7a4-45c1-a5a6-54044d4ab3cf","expr":"m.getReturnType() != null","rationale":"Return type class is never null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.246515750Z"}
{"id":"84964a68-aaca-4d5a-af48-c8ad9e9a77f8","expr":"m.getParameterTypes().length >= 0","rationale":"Parameter types array length is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.246515750Z"}
{"id":"e10ef1a4-cd63-4331-b42a-b59816aa956a","expr":"result != null","rationale":"StringBuilder.toString() always returns a non-null string","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(Class<?>[]):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.247865459Z"}
{"id":"7e2d0f7d-42a4-437f-96c1-fc4f186f4f39","expr":"result.length() >= 0","rationale":"String length is always non-negative","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(Class<?>[]):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.247865459Z"}
{"id":"ac0bc1fb-880b-4f66-9d31-ab7edea6444a","expr":"(cs.length == 0) == (result.isEmpty())","rationale":"If the input array is empty then result must be empty string; otherwise not necessarily empty","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(Class<?>[]):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.247865459Z"}
{"id":"c15db509-026b-4c6a-84f6-e187944e77bb","expr":"!result.contains(\"null\")","rationale":"Description strings returned by getDesc(Class<?>) never contain literal \"null\"","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(Class<?>[]):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.247865459Z"}
{"id":"894696b3-b038-4609-acad-e0ad28ecec5a","expr":"cs.length > 0 || result.isEmpty()","rationale":"If input array cs is empty, result string is empty","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(Class<?>[]):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.247865459Z"}
{"id":"c5accadb-9210-49b4-bf35-bfddf807a7db","expr":"c != null","rationale":"The parameter c should not be null for getDesc to process the class type descriptor.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(Class<?>):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:57.248748546Z"}
