{"id":"114098ff-739b-4867-b341-7e8ad2bdd48a","expr":"logger != null || msg == null","rationale":"If logger is null, method returns early.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.696338516Z"}
{"id":"b2e3baa1-08bc-4668-99c1-9088b76c2409","expr":"logger.isTraceEnabled() == false || logger.isTraceEnabled() == true","rationale":"The isTraceEnabled method returns a boolean.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.696338516Z"}
{"id":"34108790-e877-4d32-919e-82a7b6da7795","expr":"logger.isTraceEnabled() == false || msg != null","rationale":"If trace is enabled, msg expected to be non-null for logging.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.696338516Z"}
{"id":"4d6e41c2-e843-4a31-bfad-ee3e42a43880","expr":"msg == null || msg.length() >= 0","rationale":"Non-null msg has non-negative length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.696338516Z"}
{"id":"8c52e261-90ac-4541-b4fa-0c67d8b607a8","expr":"logger != null && (logger.isTraceEnabled() == false || logger.isTraceEnabled() == true)","rationale":"Logger nullness and isTraceEnabled boolean nature.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.696338516Z"}
{"id":"84e264a5-b398-4f43-9815-85c50f78b3c9","expr":"logger != null && logger.isTraceEnabled() == false && msg != null","rationale":"If the method is about to return, either logger is null (method returns early) or trace is not enabled; if logger is non-null at exit, trace is not enabled.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.696813513Z"}
{"id":"2b1cb412-e286-4e3d-9dbd-50b2e90ce5b4","expr":"logger != null && !logger.isTraceEnabled()","rationale":"At method exit, if logger is not null, then trace is not enabled because if enabled, the method would have called logger.trace(msg).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.696813513Z"}
{"id":"759b78ad-def9-4b93-afc8-c7d0caf1220c","expr":"!(logger != null && logger.isTraceEnabled())","rationale":"At method exit, it cannot be the case that logger is non-null and trace enabled simultaneously.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.696813513Z"}
{"id":"1d7c8b01-c151-490d-a314-b40259bc9b62","expr":"(logger == null) || !logger.isTraceEnabled()","rationale":"If logger is null or trace is not enabled, the method returns without logging; method exit point implies this invariant.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.696813513Z"}
{"id":"d8646829-5ec7-42a8-8daf-009eecd2fd30","expr":"result == true || result == false","rationale":"result is a boolean so its value must be true or false.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.DefaultSerializeClassChecker#isCheckSerializable():boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/DefaultSerializeClassChecker.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.697823280Z"}
{"id":"fcad05b3-8fb5-4dd2-8562-84240d93a095","expr":"logger != null || throwable == null","rationale":"Method returns immediately if logger is null, so no side effects.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.699069444Z"}
{"id":"632397d9-9bfa-4b16-a306-89cb2db75d66","expr":"!logger.isTraceEnabled() || throwable != null","rationale":"If tracing occurs, throwable is passed to trace, so expected throwable non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.699069444Z"}
{"id":"f1f1cc5d-db3e-42b6-b341-febbdc7991e8","expr":"logger.isTraceEnabled() == (logger != null && logger.isTraceEnabled())","rationale":"Safe to call isTraceEnabled since logger null check is first statement.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.699069444Z"}
{"id":"58455ac8-ec9b-468b-9ef9-8b3d2d520baa","expr":"logger != null && logger.isTraceEnabled() == false && throwable == null","rationale":"When logger is not null and trace is not enabled, throwable is not logged, so throwable can be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.699787039Z"}
{"id":"7551b139-91e9-4c0d-951d-ce314d85c13b","expr":"logger != null && !logger.isTraceEnabled()","rationale":"If the method is about to return, and logger is not null, either trace is enabled or not.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.699787039Z"}
{"id":"09a26a6a-df29-4782-a64d-2e28119bc40f","expr":"logger != null && (throwable == null || throwable != null)","rationale":"throwable can be null or non-null, not constrained.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.699787039Z"}
{"id":"9e57c2b6-839f-4e0d-b077-68be0760d39e","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"Method returns early if logger is null, so here logger is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.699787039Z"}
{"id":"310664cb-bb08-448d-9e2f-501ee56a95b9","expr":"logger != null && (logger.isTraceEnabled() || !logger.isTraceEnabled())","rationale":"At return logger is non-null and isTraceEnabled returns a boolean.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.699787039Z"}
{"id":"0e1e79ae-70e2-449a-8cf4-4ffec0fade39","expr":"logger != null && (!logger.isTraceEnabled() || msg != null || e != null)","rationale":"The method returns immediately if logger == null. If trace is enabled, a trace call was made with msg and e regardless of their nullness.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.700681227Z"}
{"id":"0f6edb97-aa57-4ed2-92b4-bfc005c0d6ac","expr":"logger == null || logger.isTraceEnabled()","rationale":"If logger is not null and trace is not enabled, there was no call to logger.trace.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.700681227Z"}
{"id":"be2f7268-987b-4357-a62b-c590893ea138","expr":"logger == null || (msg == null || true)","rationale":"No constraints on msg nullness at method exit except if logger is null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.700681227Z"}
{"id":"75ab5c74-5d56-49e1-87d4-44dc61804f2d","expr":"logger == null || (e == null || true)","rationale":"There are no constraints on e's nullness at method exit besides possible null logger.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.700681227Z"}
{"id":"f093a6f2-dc2f-49ed-b7b2-7df729edd191","expr":"logger != null || logger == null","rationale":"logger can be either null or not null at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.700682390Z"}
{"id":"8ce21ace-e3dc-4b52-9d58-28f9b942efee","expr":"logger == null || logger.isTraceEnabled() && logger != null","rationale":"Ensures that if isTraceEnabled is true, then logger is not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.700681227Z"}
{"id":"6772f10e-e444-423f-9c1c-ccf89228d753","expr":"logger != null || e == null","rationale":"Because the method returns early when logger is null, log operations depend on logger being non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.701395225Z"}
{"id":"91a796ce-95da-4fcc-9012-ff0f82017cd6","expr":"logger == null || logger.isDebugEnabled() == false || e != null","rationale":"If the logger is not null and debug is enabled, the Throwable e is passed to the debug method; thus e is involved in the debug call.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.701395225Z"}
{"id":"5d8cfd1e-de74-4192-9d50-5acb1ac6902e","expr":"logger == null || logger.isDebugEnabled() == false || logger.isDebugEnabled() == true","rationale":"logger.isDebugEnabled returns a boolean.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.701395225Z"}
{"id":"dd4fa460-f06e-4c4d-bc3d-9812138c371c","expr":"logger == null || e == null || logger.isDebugEnabled()","rationale":"Because if logger.debug(e) is called depends on logger.isDebugEnabled() being true.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.701395225Z"}
{"id":"c8af2f77-419f-4595-9876-682e357fafa4","expr":"logger != null || msg == null || e == null","rationale":"If logger is null, the method returns early, so msg and e can be anything.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.700966165Z"}
{"id":"edccfb75-6d8f-42a3-8bf8-b58209d9d387","expr":"logger == null || logger.isTraceEnabled() == false || msg != null || e != null","rationale":"If logger is non-null and trace is enabled, msg and e parameters are relevant for the trace call.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.700966165Z"}
{"id":"68a3606a-f5a0-47a8-95b0-0f91278a1d04","expr":"logger != null || !logger.isTraceEnabled()","rationale":"If logger is null, isTraceEnabled() should not be called so the expression is safe.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.700966165Z"}
{"id":"d7dc6f41-3280-4d6a-8761-0edda3d3e682","expr":"logger != null && logger.isDebugEnabled() || !logger.isDebugEnabled()","rationale":"At method exit, if logger was null the method would have returned early, so logger != null; the debug call only happens if isDebugEnabled is true or else it is skipped.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.702689770Z"}
{"id":"a5a9f963-137a-4d7f-9e31-cd0750b7eb22","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The method returns immediately if logger is null, so at method exit logger must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.702689770Z"}
{"id":"7eedaa95-9c77-40e5-93b4-b7d87b6952c2","expr":"logger.isDebugEnabled() || !logger.isDebugEnabled()","rationale":"logger.isDebugEnabled() returns a boolean. At method exit, either debug was called or skipped based on this.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.702689770Z"}
{"id":"e32e6b25-0f18-4f2c-9d67-114063efc18f","expr":"logger.isDebugEnabled() || e == null","rationale":"If debug is enabled then logger.debug(e) was called regardless of e, if not debug is disabled so e might be null or any Throwable.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.702689770Z"}
{"id":"0f0efe21-49e1-4e9f-8af4-d91b9d1e455d","expr":"logger.isDebugEnabled() || e != null || e == null","rationale":"e can be null or non-null, this invariant acknowledges the possible states of e.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.702689770Z"}
{"id":"1ec77576-c457-45fd-987c-77952f6de19b","expr":"logger != null && logger.isDebugEnabled() == true && msg != null","rationale":"The method only calls logger.debug(msg) if logger is not null and logger.isDebugEnabled() is true. If we are at method exit then if logger was not null and debug enabled, the method likely attempted to log the non-null msg.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.701433398Z"}
{"id":"a35b6a47-fc8c-4deb-97ee-686e5b2302a7","expr":"logger != null && !logger.isDebugEnabled()","rationale":"If logger is not null and debug is not enabled, the method exits early without calling logger.debug.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.701433398Z"}
{"id":"796eb21b-11c8-470a-a434-4a1081665585","expr":"logger == null","rationale":"The method returns immediately if logger is null, thus at method exit, if logger is null, no further checks or actions were done.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.701433398Z"}
{"id":"8824d840-e31e-4846-9ad1-efee3291f19c","expr":"msg == null || msg != null","rationale":"msg can be any String, including null or non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.700682390Z"}
{"id":"50f91007-b9c8-4ddd-8848-b0335b656f7a","expr":"logger == null || logger.isDebugEnabled() || !logger.isDebugEnabled()","rationale":"logger is either null or its debug-enabled state is true or false.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.700682390Z"}
{"id":"bb406630-f198-4e72-ae47-a9b9848cf60e","expr":"logger == null || logger.toString() != null","rationale":"If logger is not null, its toString() must return a non-null string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.700682390Z"}
{"id":"3fb3c4b3-1d3a-47a3-8438-14d2a1fa4708","expr":"msg == null || msg.length() >= 0","rationale":"msg length is always >= 0 if msg is not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.700682390Z"}
{"id":"effdbce2-4429-40b6-b502-7fdedee00553","expr":"(logger == null) || (logger.isDebugEnabled() == false) || (msg != null)","rationale":"If the method proceeds to logging, msg must be non-null; otherwise either logger is null or debug disabled.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.701433398Z"}
{"id":"c289eaa5-bff3-4242-8bf6-d1ff44f5ed28","expr":"logger != null || msg == null","rationale":"Method returns immediately if logger is null; hence logger nullness implies no guarantee on msg.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.703068435Z"}
{"id":"aa7f1f0c-c23d-4271-9f8a-7d48094c21e1","expr":"logger == null || logger.isDebugEnabled() == false || msg != null","rationale":"If debug is enabled and logger is not null, msg is expected to be non-null for logging.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.703068435Z"}
{"id":"9bbfacaa-67d2-4cf3-bc75-698b1363b30b","expr":"logger == null || logger.isDebugEnabled() == false || (msg == null || e != null || e == null)","rationale":"Protect against exception parameter nullness considering debug flag.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.703068435Z"}
{"id":"340b8d8a-934c-4b24-b1e0-556edbf5c2f7","expr":"logger == null || logger.isDebugEnabled() == false || true","rationale":"Allows method call evaluation without side effect.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.703068435Z"}
{"id":"9db96db3-62df-45bf-88c6-6f9982810ff5","expr":"logger != null || msg == null","rationale":"Method returns if logger is null, so any use of msg is guarded by logger being non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.704497544Z"}
{"id":"2727af5c-1f30-499b-af0d-a03b724ad866","expr":"logger != null || !logger.isInfoEnabled()","rationale":"logger.isInfoEnabled() can only be called if logger is not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.704497544Z"}
{"id":"9d444ffe-2e1a-4b14-85e6-e4d8a6d624ca","expr":"logger == null || logger.isInfoEnabled() || !logger.isInfoEnabled()","rationale":"logger.isInfoEnabled() returns a boolean only if logger is not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.704497544Z"}
{"id":"3c87a7c8-6c72-4b05-98b5-fc655b2c5fa5","expr":"logger == null || msg == null || logger.isInfoEnabled()","rationale":"info method is called with msg only if isInfoEnabled() is true and logger is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.704497544Z"}
{"id":"be81c22d-d982-4de3-a81d-141658eae3bb","expr":"logger != null && logger.isDebugEnabled() == false || logger.isDebugEnabled() == true","rationale":"Logger must not be null since the method returns early if null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.703737769Z"}
{"id":"462db9a7-fc32-470e-8d6c-a406ffb32243","expr":"logger != null && (!logger.isDebugEnabled() || (msg != null || e != null))","rationale":"If debug is enabled, either msg or e or both can be passed.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.703737769Z"}
{"id":"e2764bd3-b46c-4165-a91f-3e1429737a7f","expr":"logger != null && (!logger.isDebugEnabled() || (msg == null || e != null))","rationale":"e can be null even if debug is enabled.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.703737769Z"}
{"id":"3f186ab7-e4b8-4c9c-b6bb-4e0a44569c94","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"Logger cannot be null at this method exit point.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.703737769Z"}
{"id":"5271271a-a81e-4ede-bfeb-713dd6a7fd0c","expr":"logger != null && logger.isInfoEnabled() == false || (logger.isInfoEnabled() && msg != null)","rationale":"If logger.isInfoEnabled() is true, msg is passed to logger.info(msg), implying msg is likely non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.705275213Z"}
{"id":"3400e2de-94d3-476f-b7ef-d3ceb5c2ddaa","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"Method returns immediately when logger is null so at method exit logger is not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.705275213Z"}
{"id":"8ff6a6f4-6e37-4a5e-bbe5-1a1a8aa858c9","expr":"!logger.isInfoEnabled() || msg != null","rationale":"If logger is enabled, msg is passed to info so msg likely not null in that case.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.705275213Z"}
{"id":"c080752e-6fba-4459-839e-3adfdf1e5d5a","expr":"logger != null || e == null","rationale":"Given that if logger is null the method returns, so the method only proceeds if logger is not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.705981326Z"}
{"id":"0bfdae55-5e32-4ac2-a92d-b6e3995c5ef8","expr":"logger.isInfoEnabled() == false || logger != null","rationale":"If isInfoEnabled() can be called meaningfully, logger must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.705981326Z"}
{"id":"670350e1-9798-4fec-ae29-0174b953daae","expr":"(!logger.isInfoEnabled()) || true","rationale":"Expression states the trivial logical fact about isInfoEnabled, considering method context.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.705981326Z"}
{"id":"8ed35ecf-c660-4abd-ad92-f24ab906ed2a","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"At method entry, logger presence is critical for flow.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.705981326Z"}
{"id":"61337c9c-3a43-4b1f-89b2-d5f46f657621","expr":"!logger.isDebugEnabled() || (msg != null || e != null)","rationale":"If debug is enabled, at least one of msg or e could be non-null to pass to logger.debug.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.703737769Z"}
{"id":"ee946c17-c61b-4127-9457-afc7d309b78b","expr":"logger != null && !logger.isInfoEnabled() || e != null","rationale":"When method exits, either info is not enabled or e is not null because info(e) was called.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.706323272Z"}
{"id":"6b0ed085-edcf-494e-80c4-46b235e3afac","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"Logger cannot be null at method exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.706323272Z"}
{"id":"5deae499-60d7-4241-9df6-f320ac6a8767","expr":"!logger.isInfoEnabled() || e != null","rationale":"At method exit, either info logging is disabled or the Throwable e is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.706323272Z"}
{"id":"96fda608-acd7-4f31-a80f-3da26172a2ef","expr":"logger != null || msg != null","rationale":"logger can be null before method entry; if null, method returns, so msg relevance not guaranteed","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.707203805Z"}
{"id":"72a35cfd-1ea1-40f7-a852-350635f06c32","expr":"logger != null && logger.isInfoEnabled() == (msg != null || e != null)","rationale":"The method calls logger.info(msg, e) only if logger.isInfoEnabled() is true; if info is enabled and the method is called, then msg or e should not be both null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.707312360Z"}
{"id":"b7fc7d8d-7834-4167-aaef-30ffa84b6a78","expr":"!logger.isInfoEnabled() || (msg != null || e != null)","rationale":"If info is enabled, at least one of msg or e must be non-null for info to be called.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.707312360Z"}
{"id":"28cfd92e-d687-4582-b97b-4ece7127f43d","expr":"logger.isInfoEnabled() || true","rationale":"logger is not null here, so calling isInfoEnabled is safe; it returns a boolean.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.707312360Z"}
{"id":"31e899e5-770f-4269-a4f0-2fd5ab6ca7af","expr":"logger == null || logger.isInfoEnabled() || !logger.isInfoEnabled()","rationale":"logger non-null at this point and its isInfoEnabled() can be any boolean value.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.707203805Z"}
{"id":"1f5ad59e-4ac0-432e-8cce-600f1cee7109","expr":"logger != null || msg != null","rationale":"Logger being null would short-circuit the method; msg remains accessible but no warn call happens.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.707524400Z"}
{"id":"317fda7c-15cc-4816-b17b-e06b729fd5db","expr":"logger != null || e == null || e == null","rationale":"redundant expression showing e can be null if logger is null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.707203805Z"}
{"id":"41c9798c-47d9-45ae-8967-def7f9b2d914","expr":"logger == null || logger.isWarnEnabled()","rationale":"If logger is non-null, the warn checks isWarnEnabled before proceeding.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.707524400Z"}
{"id":"d8a11423-e903-4cf0-b816-10cebdd5a224","expr":"logger != null && logger.isWarnEnabled() == false","rationale":"If the method exits normally, either logger is null or warn is not enabled, since otherwise warn(msg,e) would be called and not return early.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.708157947Z"}
{"id":"0746eeed-4085-4aad-a3ab-d6ddb8fc6e83","expr":"msg != null || e != null","rationale":"It is likely that at least one of msg or e is non-null when warn is called, since both are passed as parameters to logger.warn(msg, e).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.708157947Z"}
{"id":"d21c0b29-d8df-4925-b23e-655b5a31e43d","expr":"logger.isWarnEnabled() == false || (msg != null || e != null)","rationale":"If the logger has warn enabled, then at least one of msg or e is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.708157947Z"}
{"id":"075a2d13-a226-4a16-a347-fa6bebaf378b","expr":"!logger.isWarnEnabled() || msg != null || e != null","rationale":"This invariant expresses that if warn is enabled, msg or e is not null, ensuring logger.warn(msg, e) is called with meaningful parameters.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.708157947Z"}
{"id":"026984ca-bd12-47e6-a003-ca896e3a7579","expr":"logger != null || msg == null","rationale":"If logger is null, method returns, meaning msg can be any value including null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.709228047Z"}
{"id":"c4043e78-a076-407e-bcb7-5fe8433d913d","expr":"logger != null && !logger.isWarnEnabled() || msg != null","rationale":"If logger is enabled for warn, msg should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.709228047Z"}
{"id":"2f7b678a-544e-42ad-a835-4034d0b89a9f","expr":"logger != null || msg != null","rationale":"At least one of logger or msg is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.709228047Z"}
{"id":"84afd6c8-67d1-42ca-9383-b9045439f3f1","expr":"logger == null || logger.isWarnEnabled() || !logger.isWarnEnabled()","rationale":"Logger either null or warn enabled or not warn enabled (always true but exhaustive).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.709228047Z"}
{"id":"e34238ee-a42a-41fa-8dc8-22ffa3c4dc97","expr":"logger != null && !logger.isWarnEnabled() || (logger != null && logger.isWarnEnabled() && msg != null)","rationale":"If the logger is not null and warn is enabled, msg must have been passed to logger.warn(msg). Otherwise, warn is not enabled or logger is null, but logger is known non-null here as method returned earlier if null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.709655364Z"}
{"id":"62132eff-8565-42b1-a011-7ffcb4ba4141","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The method returns early if logger is null, so at method exit logger cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.709655364Z"}
{"id":"f3f7f406-81bd-4da7-8875-99f920b78e66","expr":"(logger == null) || logger.isWarnEnabled() == false || msg != null","rationale":"If logger is enabled for warn, the msg argument is passed to warn, implying msg is used non-null or possibly null, but presence of warn depends on msg validity.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.709655364Z"}
{"id":"af1124a0-625d-417a-a0f0-6c5aab6d5c8c","expr":"logger != null || e == null","rationale":"If logger is null then the method returns, so e being null has no requirement.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.709972754Z"}
{"id":"258ab390-4d77-4c99-98b1-b1aa5440121b","expr":"logger != null && !logger.isWarnEnabled() || e != null","rationale":"If logger is not null and warn is enabled, the method proceeds to warn with e; e can be null if warn is disabled.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.709972754Z"}
{"id":"9021cbd4-4dbd-4621-b4c2-e361c99ca896","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"Method returns immediately if logger is null, so for any further code logger is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.709972754Z"}
{"id":"4a43ff20-1be5-4674-bee4-a4e2900c1d5d","expr":"logger.isWarnEnabled() == false || e != null","rationale":"Either warn is not enabled or e is non-null before invoking logger.warn(e).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.709972754Z"}
{"id":"438c767e-75ee-4833-ba51-7a7289bdcc1e","expr":"logger.isWarnEnabled() || e == null","rationale":"If logger.isWarnEnabled() is true, e may be null or non-null, for the warn call.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.709972754Z"}
{"id":"26d1394c-cc8b-4ec8-bf20-b2337235e9ee","expr":"logger != null && logger.isWarnEnabled() && e != null","rationale":"Method calls logger.isWarnEnabled() and logger.warn(e) occur only when logger is non-null and warning is enabled; e's presence implies it is not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.710170808Z"}
{"id":"ebdadea6-51f6-4cd2-b2c7-af28a119c957","expr":"logger != null && !logger.isWarnEnabled()","rationale":"If logger is non-null but warning is not enabled, then logger.warn(e) is not called.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.710170808Z"}
{"id":"316d15b9-d295-4b1a-b4e7-1cea5b74412b","expr":"(logger == null) || logger.isWarnEnabled()","rationale":"If logger is null, method returns early; else if warning is enabled, calls warn.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.710170808Z"}
{"id":"90501685-d2c4-434b-b25e-e31b4a326474","expr":"logger != null || e != null","rationale":"At method entry, logger could be null, but e may or may not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#error(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.710857124Z"}
{"id":"bd8bc7e3-9e90-445c-809e-357112615e99","expr":"logger == null || logger.isErrorEnabled() == true || logger.isErrorEnabled() == false","rationale":"At method entry, the logger's error enabled state can be either true or false when logger is not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#error(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.710857124Z"}
{"id":"f03b4017-9918-4e4f-8879-8a2d4d7c62f6","expr":"logger != null || msg == null","rationale":"If logger is null, method returns immediately, so no further relationship to msg.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#error(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.711406110Z"}
{"id":"e4ff562c-d396-4781-942d-be71fad9f688","expr":"logger == null || logger.isErrorEnabled() == false || msg != null","rationale":"If logger is non-null and error is enabled, then msg should be non-null to log a message.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#error(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.711406110Z"}
{"id":"94cbc356-2d83-4da8-b26e-bbe2a2bc8b4e","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"Since the method returns if logger is null, otherwise code continues, so at entry logger may be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#error(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.711406110Z"}
{"id":"aa44511e-74aa-4651-a569-568281ec0aff","expr":"logger != null && (logger.isErrorEnabled() == false || msg != null)","rationale":"Logging error with null message likely not intended; either error logging is disabled or msg is present.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#error(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.711406110Z"}
{"id":"1b50905d-a87d-4059-b915-9cbf3d004fcb","expr":"logger != null && logger.isErrorEnabled() == true && msg != null","rationale":"The method returns only if logger is non-null and error logging was enabled. Then logger.error(msg) is invoked, so msg is the argument passed.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#error(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.711891698Z"}
{"id":"65dda5ef-7ef9-4abd-be1f-fe808723d039","expr":"logger != null && !logger.isErrorEnabled()","rationale":"If logger is non-null but error logging is not enabled, logger.error is not called.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#error(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.711891698Z"}
{"id":"a6d588d6-b6b3-40b5-900d-aea4740eaecb","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The method returns early if logger == null, so on exit logger is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#error(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.711891698Z"}
{"id":"2a2a3943-f06b-4088-8306-d8ff3dc43625","expr":"msg == null || logger.isErrorEnabled()","rationale":"If msg == null, error may have been called with null, or not called if isErrorEnabled is false.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#error(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.711891698Z"}
{"id":"56df1377-9ab3-4dd4-91d5-24cb0cdf9f7f","expr":"!logger.isErrorEnabled() || logger != null","rationale":"If logger is null, method returns early; otherwise isErrorEnabled is evaluated.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#error(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.711891698Z"}
{"id":"79188902-7246-49b0-a8cc-a06e78b8066f","expr":"pojoClazz != null","rationale":"Typically, class parameters in such utility methods are expected to be non-null for meaningful checks.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ProtobufUtils#isProtobufClass(Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ProtobufUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.711978231Z"}
{"id":"0499a3e2-b923-44fd-bae0-f2cb98870193","expr":"pojoClazz.isInterface() == false","rationale":"Protobuf classes for serialization purposes are usually not interfaces.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ProtobufUtils#isProtobufClass(Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ProtobufUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.711978231Z"}
{"id":"dca7455c-48ca-4545-8dd4-dc92e13c488a","expr":"pojoClazz.isAnnotation() == false","rationale":"This utility likely checks for actual class types, not annotation types.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ProtobufUtils#isProtobufClass(Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ProtobufUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T23:30:58.711978231Z"}
